  "project_description": "This module provides your website with currency conversion, currency information & metadata, and amount/price display functionality.\n\n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n For end users:\n \n Currency conversion page \n Currency conversion input filter \n Amount/price display input filter \n \n \n API (features for other modules)\n \n Currency information & metadata \n Pluggable currency conversion API. Ships with custom and historical fixed rates. Also supports Yahoo! Finance . \n Tokens \n Amount/price form element \n Currency Views handlers \n Amount/price Views field handler \n \n \n \n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n \n PHP 5.5/7.0 or higher, with BC Math . \n Composer \n Plugin \n Back to top",
